This Amendment is made between Brae Foods Ltd (the "Buyer") and Kilmore Farms Ltd (the "Seller") and amends the Produce Supply Agreement.

The parties agree the following changes:

(a) clause 2.1: "monthly" is replaced by "quarterly";

(b) clause 2.2: deleted;

(c) new clause 2.4: the Seller shall give the Buyer 14 days' notice of any harvest shortfall.

